> Original consecutive observations and genuine estimated flow

Use boxing0/handclapping1/handwaving2,scenario1,people1..4fit/5validation/6test,
first two original annotated segments per AVI. Same18original KTH AVIs as the
preceding video reports,pinned mirror7076149bdbeff8d70003a68d6291fd080db44683.
Here select eleven CONSECUTIVE frames centered within each segment,not the
sixteen widely spaced observations of the earlier video models. Original zero-
based frame IDs,bounds,video/person/segment IDs and source SHA256 remain in
manifest.json. FFmpeg only decodes;Float32tensor bilinear96px/255prepares RGB.
The actual middle frame supplies the spatial branch;ten adjacent pairs produce
signed dx/dy fields. No labels enter flow estimation or source-frame selection.

Declare the flow adaptation:single-scale Horn–Schunck-style quadratic brightness
and first-difference smoothness,alpha.05,400explicit tensorSGD(.2)steps from0.
This is estimated small-motion flow,not ground truth,Farneback,TV-L1 or the
paper's flow preprocessing. No warping,pyramid or large-motion accuracy claim.
Preparation retains every resized original frame and initial/final energy.

```{cpp, flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  const std::filesystem::path cache = dm::datasets::data_home();
  dm::datasets::prepare_example_data("two_stream", (cache / "two_stream").string());
}
```
