\alttext(Exact recorded true-row predicted-column counts rendered by the confusion-matrix SVG API.)

> Conclusion

Original adjacent observations and declared tensor flow estimation make both modalities inspectable. Complete stream graphs,independent formula checks,explicit joint Adam,paired source identities and all held-out/control errors support an implementation example without a published flow or action benchmark claim.

> References

- [Simonyan and Zisserman(2014),Two-Stream Convolutional Networks for Action Recognition in Videos](https://arxiv.org/abs/1406.2199).
- [Horn and Schunck(1981),Determining Optical Flow](https://people.csail.mit.edu/bkph/papers/Optical_Flow_OPT.pdf).
- [Original KTH action data](https://www.csc.kth.se/cvap/actions/).
